{
  "slug": "tdd-evolutionary-loop",
  "name": "Tdd Evolutionary Loop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automate the TDD cycle with a collaborative agent team: two parallel coders and a devil's advocate, working on isolated files for rapid, safe iteration. Describe a feature or point to failing tests and the plugin handles the rest — writing tests, implementing in parallel variants, reviewing code quality, and promoting the best result.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `tdd-loop`\n- **Agents** (2): `coder`, `devils-advocate`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tdd-evolutionary-loop@claude-community` from `mblando9988/tdd-evolutionary-loop`.\n\nAutomate test-driven development with a collaborative agent team. Two coder agents implement features in parallel on isolated files while a devil's advocate agent reviews their work.",
